proxilens (2.1.0~beta4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Create a safe development package containing only the desktop UI.
  * Exclude legacy PAM module, privileged helper, wake agent and GNOME extension.
  * Add direct Duo Push diagnostics and an in-memory-only 15-minute grant simulation.
  * Explicitly keep sudo, PAM and Polkit integration disabled.

 -- ProxiLens Maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>  Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:40:00 +0100

proxilens (2.1.0~beta2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add interactive PAM Duo-first authentication with explicit Ubuntu-password
    fallback and abort choice for sudo and Polkit.
  * Preserve the shared session-scoped Duo grant and existing Polkit network
    sandbox drop-in.

 -- ProxiLens Maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>  Tue, 25 Nov 2026 06:45:00 +0100

proxilens (2.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

